<blockquote>
<p dir=3D"auto">For PDF ingestion, install the <code>pdf</code> extra inste=
ad: <code>pip install graphrag-sdk[litellm,pdf]</code>.
Ingestion sanitizes unsupported control characters in IDs and string proper=
ties before graph upserts, which helps avoid FalkorDB Cypher parse errors o=
n noisy PDFs.</p>
</blockquote>
